# ============================================================
#  Composite free energy  --  STEP 1 of 2
#  DFT geometry + Gibbs thermal correction (dispersion ON).
#  Produces <basename>.xyz with the optimized geometry, which
#  step 2 reads. Run this first.
#  Verified runnable on ORCA 6.1.1.
#
#  Why two files (not one $new_job input):
#  a D4 dispersion flag carries across $new_job into the
#  coupled-cluster step, and ORCA forbids dispersion + CCSD(T)
#  together (CC already contains dispersion). Splitting the
#  jobs keeps the CC step clean.
# ============================================================
! B3LYP D4 def2-TZVP RIJCOSX def2/J TightOpt Freq

%maxcore 3000

* xyzfile 0 1 mol.xyz
